      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">U, A, E, A</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">U = 10<br />\nA = 2<br />\nE = 4<br />\nA = 2</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Sum of vowel values:</span><br />\n10 + 2 + 4 + 2 = <strong>18</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct option is </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Option 3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">.</span></p>\n",
