      "id": "e0e1ea1852e9-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "In a series of seminars held daily from 11th to 18th Feb, Calicut - 18th Feb 2022, Patna - 12th Feb 2022, Tiruchirappalli - 17th Feb 2022, Raipur - 11th Feb 2022, Rourkela - 14th Feb 2022 Jamshedpur - 13th Feb 2022, Durgapur - 15th Feb 2022, Warangal - 16th Feb 2022 If the seminar in Jamshedpur was held on a Sunday, which day of the week was the seminar in Calicut?",
      "questionHtml": "In a series of seminars held daily from 11th to 18th Feb, Calicut - 18th Feb 2022, Patna - 12th Feb 2022, Tiruchirappalli - 17th Feb 2022,<br />\nRaipur - 11th Feb 2022, Rourkela - 14th Feb 2022 Jamshedpur - 13th Feb 2022, Durgapur - 15th Feb 2022, Warangal - 16th Feb 2022<br />\nIf the seminar in Jamshedpur was held on a Sunday, which day of the week was the seminar in Calicut?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Tuesday",
          "html": "Tuesday"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Wednesday",
          "html": "Wednesday"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Friday",
          "html": "Friday"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Sunday",
          "html": "Sunday"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>So, 13th Feb 2022 = Sunday</p>\n\n<p>Now counting forward:</p>\n\n<p>14th Feb – Monday<br />\n15th Feb – Tuesday<br />\n16th Feb – Wednesday<br />\n17th Feb – Thursday<br />\n<strong>18th Feb – Friday</strong></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct option is <strong>Option 3</strong>.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
