          "text": "22%",
          "html": "22%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">After 1st year:<br />\n100 + 10% of 100 = 100 + 10 = 110</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">After 2nd year:<br />\n110 + 20% of 110 = 110 + 22 = 132</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Total increase = 132 − 100 = 32</span></p>\n\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hence, the correct answer is </span><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Option 2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">.</span></div>\n",
