      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: All engineers are skilled. No unskilled person is allowed. Conclusions: I. All engineers are allowed. II. No skilled person is unskilled.",
      "questionHtml": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.<br />\nStatement:<br />\nAll engineers are skilled. No unskilled person is allowed.<br />\nConclusions:<br />\nI. All engineers are allowed.<br />\nII. No skilled person is unskilled.",
